OL,3,GNEWSALonger jail term for driver who
OL,4,Akilled boyfriend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who killed her teenage
OL,7,Fboyfriend in a car crash has had her
OL,8,Fjail term increased by a year and a
OL,9,Fhalf.
OL,11,FMia Howarth, now 21, filmed 17-year-old
OL,12,FAlfie Lovett hanging out of her car's
OL,13,Fpassenger window while she was driving
OL,14,Fin North Yorkshire on 12 September
OL,15,F2023.
OL,17,FYork Crown Court heard in March she
OL,18,Fthen lost control of her Peugeot 107,
OL,19,Fcausing it to veer off the road and
OL,20,Fcrash into a wall near Brimham Rocks,
OL,21,Fkilling Lovett.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
