OL,3,GNEWSALonger jail term for driver who
OL,4,Akilled boyfriend
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowarth admitted causing death by
OL,7,Fdangerous driving and was jailed for
OL,8,Fthree years, but the Attorney General
OL,9,Fsaid the term was "unduly lenient" and
OL,10,Freferred the case to the Court of
OL,11,FAppeal, where judges on Friday
OL,12,Fincreased it to four and a half years.
